  "description": "JANSNO X70 Dual Battery Fat Tire Electric Bike – Ultimate All-Terrain E-Bike for Long-Range Adventures\nThe JANSNO X70 is a high-performance electric fat tire bike designed for riders seeking power, range, and versatility. Equipped with a robust 750W brushless rear hub motor and a 48V 37Ah dual lithium battery system, it delivers exceptional torque and an impressive range of up to 120 km in pedal-assist mode.\n\n🌟 Why Choose the JANSNO X70?\n\nExtended Range: Dual battery setup ensures longer rides without frequent charging.\n\nVersatile Terrain Handling: Fat tires and suspension system provide stability across various terrains.\n\nCargo-Friendly Design: Extended seat and optional rear rack accommodate additional gear for commuting or adventures.\n\nUser-Friendly Features: Removable batteries and intuitive NFC display enhance the riding experience.\n\nYour Ultimate Weekend Camping Partner for Two\nEscape the daily grind and create unforgettable moments with your partner using the Jansno X70. Designed for adventure, its powerful high-capacity battery ensures extended range, letting you explore scenic trails and hidden getaways with ease. Perfect for weekend camping trips, the X70 is your trusted companion for reaching serene lakesides, picturesque hills, or wherever your hearts lead you. Pack your essentials, load up the X70, and embark on a journey of togetherness and discovery. Let the adventure begin!",
